<img src="icondata/cow.gif" border=0>
</td><td width=90%><font color=#000000>Is there a limit on how many players can enter a raid instance?<br><br>Different raid encounters are designed with different numbers of players in mind. Some are made for a single group while others are built for a maximum of four groups (24 players). We believe this number emphasizes the intimate, rewarding feeling of medium-sized raids where skill plays a much more important role than simply having huge numbers. Designing raids with a predetermined number of players in mind gives us a very precise level of control over encounter balance and risk versus reward. Ultimately this allows us to create very compelling and complex content.<br><br>O_O~<br>Busy Lizard - Nella</font><div align=right><small>
<br><font color=#990000> </font>
<br><font color=#000099>10/ 1(Fri) 03:28</font><font color=#000000>
